<p>Electricians juggle Class A and Class B FSR tickets, EV charger installations growing 60% year-over-year, panel upgrades for heat-pump conversions, and the constant pressure of permit-pulling contractors who undercut by skipping the BC Safety Authority paperwork. The licensed electrician needs a channel that screens for it.</p>

</section>
